The app definitions, documentation and images in zigbee2mqtt-*/ are generated from
the official Zigbee2MQTT Home Assistant app:
https://github.com/zigbee2mqtt/hassio-zigbee2mqtt (Apache License 2.0, see LICENSE).

Changes made by scripts/sync.py, per instance:
- name, slug, panel_title, description and url changed so the copy installs alongside the official app
- default options.data_path changed to /config/zigbee2mqtt_<n>
- host port mappings removed (set to null) so copies don't collide on port 8485
- a preamble added at the top of DOCS.md; README.md replaced

The container image, version, options schema and everything else are unchanged.
